        {
          "line": 467,
          "text": "            ), f\"Half Normal weight must be > 0 (got -1:{self.bucket_widths[-1]}).\""
        },
        {
          "line": 468,
          "text": "            # This fixes the distribution if the half normal at zero is width zero"
